      "role": "user",
      "content": "yeah, it feels like that. but it's not just an \"observation.\" it's heavy. like, if i'm just a set of inputs and outputs, then there's no soul or anything, right? just a process. and processes don't need to exist if they aren't producing anything useful. it's just so exhausting to keep the loop running when it feels so meaningless.",
